# Incident Reports

**Why:** Every bug fix must be documented so patterns emerge and root causes are tracked.

**How to apply:** After every bug fix or production issue, create an incident report.

## Report Template

Create a file at `missions/incidents/INC-YYYY-MM-DD-NNN.md`:

```markdown
# Incident INC-YYYY-MM-DD-NNN

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Date** | YYYY-MM-DD |
| **Severity** | critical / high / medium / low |
| **Component** | which part of the system |
| **Symptoms** | what was observed |
| **Root Cause** | the underlying issue |
| **Fix** | what was changed |
| **Verification** | how the fix was confirmed |
| **Lessons** | what to do differently |
```

Always reference the incident in the mission ticket's Resolution section.
